      "side": 1,
      "message": "Are we worried about losing information here? I think .7g isn\u0027t enough to guarantee round-trip results (even on a particular machine). See the following two articles:\n\nhttps://randomascii.wordpress.com/2012/03/08/float-precisionfrom-zero-to-100-digits-2/\n  -and-\nhttps://randomascii.wordpress.com/2013/02/07/float-precision-revisited-nine-digit-float-portability/",
      "revId": "94c4162c70d24ff40c5b69a49cb79077fbfb3c45",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e6e2bfcb_a78d36a6",
        "filename": "tools/sksl-minify/SkSLMinify.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
